  name: Battery Tester
  description: A battery tester is a device used to check the condition and charge
    level of a vehicle's battery. It measures voltage, cold cranking amps (CCA),
    and overall battery health to determine if the battery is functioning properly
    or needs replacement. Battery testers can be analog or digital, and are commonly
    used in automotive maintenance and diagnostics.
